    <bpmn:process id="W_W1783" name="W1783. Multi-Tender Transaction Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer uses multiple payment methods (e.g., partial installment + partial cash)
Frequency: ~10–15% of installment transactions involve multi-tender (≈12,000–18,000/month at the W747 base)
Volume: ~12,000–18,000 multi-tender transactions/month (per the Frequency&#x27;s 10–15% at the W747 base)
Owner: Revenue Accountant
Participants: Revenue Accountant, Cashier, Treasury
Source: workflow W1783 — Multi-Tender Transaction Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1783_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1783_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1783_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1783_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1783_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1783_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1783_Lane3" name="Revenue Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1783_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1783_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1783_Start5" name="Customer uses multiple payment methods (e.g., partial installment + partial cash)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1783_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1783_Task6" name="Multi-tender scenarios: (a) customer purchases PHP 20K appliance: pays PHP 5K…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Multi-tender scenarios: (a) customer purchases PHP 20K appliance: pays PHP 5K cash, PHP 15K on 12-month installment, (b) customer uses loyalty points + credit card installment, (c) customer uses GCash + BNPL for remaining balance
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1783_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1783_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1783_Task7" name="System records each tender separately: (a) cash portion: deposited daily, (b)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System records each tender separately: (a) cash portion: deposited daily, (b) installment portion: settled by financing partner at T+1 to T+3, (c) loyalty points: liability reduction, (d) e-wallet: settled per e-wallet provider terms
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1783_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1783_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1783_Task8" name="Reconciliation: Revenue Accountant ensures total transaction amount equals sum…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconciliation: Revenue Accountant ensures total transaction amount equals sum of all tenders; each tender component reconciled to its respective settlement channel
Responsible (R): Revenue Accountant
Accountable (A): Accounting Manager
Duration: Part of daily reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1783_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1783_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1783_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1783_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-208 (ensure consumer-financing settlement &amp; compliance.) | - operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Revenue Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
