    <bpmn:process id="W_W1784" name="W1784. Financing Partner Payment Exception Handling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Settlement delay, partial settlement, or settlement error from financing partner
Frequency: ~10–20 exceptions/month
Volume: Low volume but requires timely resolution
Owner: Treasury
Participants: Treasury, Financing Partner, Accounting Manager
Source: workflow W1784 — Financing Partner Payment Exception Handling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1784_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1784_Lane1" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1784_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1784_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1784_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1784_Lane2" name="Accounting Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1784_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1784_Lane3" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1784_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1784_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1784_Start5" name="Settlement delay, partial settlement, or settlement error from financing partner">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1784_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1784_Task6" name="Exception types: (a) settlement not received by expected date (T+2 or T+3), (b)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Exception types: (a) settlement not received by expected date (T+2 or T+3), (b) settlement amount differs from expected (short settlement), (c) duplicate settlement (partner pays twice), (d) settlement for wrong merchant (BuildRight receives another merchant&#x27;s settlement), (e) partner system outage (no settlement file)
Responsible (R): Treasury
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Event-driven</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1784_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1784_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1784_Task7" name="Treasury contacts partner for resolution: (a) escalates to partner&#x27;s merchant…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury contacts partner for resolution: (a) escalates to partner&#x27;s merchant support, (b) documents communication, (c) tracks exception in reconciliation log, (d) target resolution: 5 business days
Responsible (R): Treasury
Accountable (A): Accounting Manager
Duration: 1–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1784_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1784_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1784_Task8" name="GL adjustment if needed: (a) if settlement permanently short: record loss or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: GL adjustment if needed: (a) if settlement permanently short: record loss or adjust MDR, (b) if settlement delayed but expected: no adjustment (accrue), (c) if duplicate: return excess to partner
Responsible (R): Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1784_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1784_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1784_Task9" name="Chronic issues (&gt; 3 exceptions in 30 days from same partner): CFO escalates to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Chronic issues (&gt; 3 exceptions in 30 days from same partner): CFO escalates to partner management; considers partner termination if systemic
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: As needed</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1784_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1784_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1784_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1784_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-208 (ensure consumer-financing settlement &amp; compliance.) | - operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Treasury</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
